WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.030 --> 00:01.520
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

4
00:01.540 --> 00:02.820
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

5
00:02.840 --> 00:03.990
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

6
00:04.010 --> 00:05.010
viewer discretion is advised]

7
00:05.300 --> 00:06.490
I give you my word

8
00:06.900 --> 00:09.720
that I shall not brush against your child, Madam Ratchapee,

9
00:10.200 --> 00:11.790
until you can be certain

10
00:12.010 --> 00:13.690
that my love is nothing but pure.

11
00:13.990 --> 00:16.800
Didn't you promise we'd walk a long way together, hand in hand?

12
00:17.010 --> 00:19.560
Why are you leaving me like this, my beloved?

13
00:22.700 --> 00:24.040
Peem! They're gonna blister, dear!

14
00:25.700 --> 00:27.900
If any merits I have made

15
00:27.920 --> 00:30.310
still remain,

16
00:31.000 --> 00:34.300
may you take me back to Phop Phra.

17
00:35.710 --> 00:38.560
[Two months later]

18
00:42.200 --> 00:45.290
The doctor said that you've started to become responsive

19
00:45.830 --> 00:48.200
over the past two to three days.

20
00:49.200 --> 00:51.490
You're not giving up, right, Phu?

21
00:52.410 --> 00:54.670
I won't give up either.

22
00:55.110 --> 00:57.610
I intend to live my normal life

23
00:58.520 --> 01:01.200
as the same old Lieutenant Peem.

24
01:01.800 --> 01:04.120
Whatever wears me down,

25
01:04.710 --> 01:07.190
I promise I will ignore it all.

26
01:07.500 --> 01:10.080
My only duty right now

27
01:11.400 --> 01:13.300
is to live my life

28
01:14.410 --> 01:15.990
and be patient

29
01:16.190 --> 01:19.920
until it's time for me to be with her again.

30
01:22.110 --> 01:24.420
Wake up soon, Phu.

31
01:26.400 --> 01:29.740
There's someone I want to introduce to you.

32
02:36.810 --> 02:37.810
Peem.

33
02:39.100 --> 02:41.040
Stop doing this to me.

34
02:42.310 --> 02:44.160
Tell me what you want.

35
02:45.010 --> 02:46.350
You think

36
02:46.360 --> 02:48.680
I'm back to normal, right?

37
02:49.490 --> 02:50.920
Of course, I do!

38
02:51.100 --> 02:52.240
So what?

39
02:53.110 --> 02:55.880
Are you saying you've been fine all along,

40
02:56.510 --> 02:58.840
even when you starved yourself

41
02:58.870 --> 02:59.800
and let yourself rot

42
02:59.810 --> 03:02.120
like a zombie for a month?

43
03:03.610 --> 03:05.880
The reason you've gotten better

44
03:06.520 --> 03:08.180
is because...

45
03:08.200 --> 03:11.350
you've spent some time away from that woman.

46
03:15.850 --> 03:18.800
This is the last time I'm telling you that

47
03:19.010 --> 03:20.760
I've never been cursed with black magic,

48
03:21.610 --> 03:23.600
nor has she ever wished ill upon me.

49
03:26.070 --> 03:28.150
And if something's still bugging you

50
03:28.160 --> 03:29.320
about this whole thing,

51
03:29.340 --> 03:30.890
or if you have anything more to prove,

52
03:30.900 --> 03:32.000
be my guest.

53
03:32.220 --> 03:33.600
But I would like to tell you

54
03:33.610 --> 03:35.960
that this will be the end of it

55
03:36.510 --> 03:37.380
because...

56
03:37.390 --> 03:39.800
I will prove nothing more to you.

57
03:40.300 --> 03:41.600
What if I don't let this end?

58
03:44.200 --> 03:45.900
Then just take it as if...

59
03:46.400 --> 03:48.810
I'm dead to you.

60
03:50.390 --> 03:51.280
Peem,

61
03:51.300 --> 03:53.280
why would you say that?!

62
04:33.810 --> 04:35.370
I know...

63
04:35.380 --> 04:37.800
how I could help you, dear.

64
04:59.200 --> 05:03.490
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

65
05:03.510 --> 05:08.100
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

66
05:08.110 --> 05:12.370
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

67
05:12.390 --> 05:16.760
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

68
05:16.780 --> 05:21.170
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

69
05:21.190 --> 05:25.690
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

70
05:25.710 --> 05:29.790
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

71
05:29.810 --> 05:34.270
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

72
05:34.280 --> 05:40.410
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

73
06:04.520 --> 06:05.520
You...

74
06:06.210 --> 06:08.680
You have foul magic running through you.

75
06:08.810 --> 06:11.410
It is filthy and evil.

76
06:11.810 --> 06:13.210
It will wreak havoc on you

77
06:13.590 --> 06:15.960
and your family.

78
06:16.200 --> 06:17.290
Grandmaster,

79
06:17.310 --> 06:18.560
what do we have to do?

80
06:18.720 --> 06:19.680
I will perform a ritual

81
06:19.900 --> 06:21.720
to exorcise a wicked spirit from your daughter.

82
06:27.000 --> 06:28.090
Ghost-banishing rattan cane.

83
06:29.110 --> 06:31.600
I will beat the ghost out of your daughter.

84
06:41.290 --> 06:42.680
This evil spirit

85
06:42.700 --> 06:43.960
possesses immense strength.

86
06:44.190 --> 06:46.280
Is there any other way to exorcise it, Grandmaster?

87
06:46.730 --> 06:47.940
This is no daughter of yours.

88
06:48.700 --> 06:51.570
I am forcing this ghost to reveal itself.

89
06:52.320 --> 06:53.500
What do you say?

90
06:54.160 --> 06:56.560
Do you agree to let me exorcise it from your daughter?

91
07:07.310 --> 07:08.480
Mom,

92
07:12.100 --> 07:14.490
if I agree to let

93
07:16.390 --> 07:18.310
a phony exorcist

94
07:18.600 --> 07:20.980
perform an exorcism on me this time,

95
07:24.230 --> 07:26.400
you will believe me

96
07:28.210 --> 07:30.980
that my feelings from now on

97
07:32.000 --> 07:34.300
are genuine

98
07:36.000 --> 07:38.140
and that I'm not possessed by anything, right?

99
08:10.610 --> 08:12.000
Leave, you evil spirit!

100
08:45.910 --> 08:47.320
Peem, my dear grandbaby.

101
08:47.330 --> 08:48.370
Peem...

102
08:50.500 --> 08:52.600
What's going on, huh?

103
08:57.330 --> 08:58.480
What is this, dear?

104
09:00.790 --> 09:02.230
What happened to you?

105
09:02.400 --> 09:03.680
Let me see.

106
09:05.420 --> 09:06.480
Peem!

107
09:07.900 --> 09:09.720
What happened to you, dear?!

108
09:10.620 --> 09:11.780
What happened, dear?

109
09:12.990 --> 09:13.680
What went on?!

110
09:13.690 --> 09:15.930
Tell me what went on, dear!

111
09:17.220 --> 09:18.220
Huh?

112
09:21.920 --> 09:23.000
Don't touch her!

113
09:25.110 --> 09:26.720
This has gone too far.

114
09:28.010 --> 09:29.800
All these years, I've raised my granddaughter

115
09:30.800 --> 09:33.480
and kept her safe from every little harm.

116
09:34.410 --> 09:37.010
What kind of despicable mother are you?!

117
09:37.510 --> 09:41.320
Did you hand over your own flesh and blood just to let someone hurt her?!

118
09:42.010 --> 09:44.120
All this time, I've never stopped you from doing whatever you wanted

119
09:44.360 --> 09:45.620
if it gave you peace of mind,

120
09:45.640 --> 09:47.670
but doing this to your daughter is taking it way too far!

121
09:51.000 --> 09:53.000
Ask yourself, huh?

122
09:53.200 --> 09:55.300
Ask yourself how out of your mind you've become.

123
09:55.320 --> 09:56.550
Are you even still human?!

124
09:56.560 --> 09:57.440
Tell me, huh?

125
09:57.450 --> 09:59.200
You're too far gone!

126
10:02.610 --> 10:04.510
I miss my old mom,

127
10:07.910 --> 10:11.280
the mom who put her three children's happiness first.

128
10:15.110 --> 10:17.300
I don't understand

129
10:18.900 --> 10:21.680
what could have made you change so drastically.

130
10:24.800 --> 10:28.300
If anyone in this house is possessed,

131
10:30.000 --> 10:31.600
I don't think it's anyone

132
10:32.900 --> 10:34.240
but you, Mom.

133
10:46.320 --> 10:47.200
Peem...

134
11:12.410 --> 11:14.240
I'm begging you, Pat.

135
11:15.700 --> 11:17.520
Do not take him with you.

136
11:19.400 --> 11:21.410
Please let Phu stay with me.

137
11:21.680 --> 11:25.000
[Pichapat Ruechakun]

138
11:51.160 --> 11:53.400
By the power of all sacred beings

139
11:54.410 --> 11:58.300
and the merits I have accumulated throughout my past

140
11:58.920 --> 12:00.410
and present lives,

141
12:02.110 --> 12:04.900
may you all

142
12:05.720 --> 12:09.600
drive out all evil residing within my body,

143
12:10.100 --> 12:11.960
as well as my mother's.

144
12:30.600 --> 12:31.840
Darling...

145
12:32.800 --> 12:33.840
Mom...

146
12:34.420 --> 12:35.800
please help me.

147
12:43.810 --> 12:48.510
"This incantation shall help Mrs. Ratchapee return to her usual self."

148
13:12.700 --> 13:14.410
Does it hurt badly, my dear?

149
13:27.000 --> 13:28.000
Peem...

150
13:29.420 --> 13:31.110
please listen to me.

151
13:33.010 --> 13:34.200
I'm sorry.

152
13:36.110 --> 13:38.580
I'm sorry for everything I've done.

153
13:41.200 --> 13:44.410
I should have been the happiest person in the world,

154
13:45.210 --> 13:47.120
seeing you happy

155
13:49.050 --> 13:50.500
with someone you love

156
13:51.200 --> 13:52.900
who loves you back.

157
13:54.500 --> 13:56.500
I have no idea what kind of wicked spirit

158
13:56.510 --> 13:58.110
possessed me,

159
13:58.810 --> 14:01.000
forcing me to do all those things to you.

160
14:04.300 --> 14:06.320
You must already hate me.

161
14:08.200 --> 14:10.790
I haven't been acting like a mother to you at all.

162
14:22.490 --> 14:23.560
No,

163
14:24.490 --> 14:26.620
I've never hated you.

164
14:28.820 --> 14:30.210
Not even once.

165
14:33.110 --> 14:34.720
I'm sorry, Peem,

166
14:35.310 --> 14:38.210
for being the reason everything turned out this way.

167
14:38.480 --> 14:39.760
Please forgive me.

168
14:39.780 --> 14:41.280
I really didn't mean it.

169
14:42.200 --> 14:45.100
I never wanted it to turn out like this, Peem.

170
14:45.640 --> 14:47.800
I'm sorry, Peem.

171
14:55.690 --> 14:57.290
I'm sorry...

172
15:00.510 --> 15:02.680
It's alright, Mom.

173
15:06.420 --> 15:09.110
Don't apologize to me anymore.

174
15:10.910 --> 15:13.090
Because I want

175
15:13.810 --> 15:15.500
nothing more than

176
15:17.900 --> 15:21.590
for my old mother to finally come back.

177
15:22.500 --> 15:24.410
I'm back, Peem.

178
15:25.340 --> 15:27.110
I'm back.

179
15:42.590 --> 15:43.900
So that means...

180
15:45.210 --> 15:47.920
you already accepted Master Bulan?

181
15:53.300 --> 15:55.000
Whoever my daughter loves,

182
15:56.200 --> 15:57.790
I will also love.

183
16:04.300 --> 16:05.510
Then...

184
16:06.910 --> 16:09.040
may I go see her?

185
16:14.090 --> 16:15.850
I miss her.

186
16:17.220 --> 16:19.110
I really miss her, Mom.

187
16:20.790 --> 16:22.610
But the wounds on your back...

188
16:23.910 --> 16:25.320
I'm fine, Mom.

189
16:25.900 --> 16:27.600
It doesn't hurt too bad.

190
16:30.210 --> 16:31.490
Please, Mom?

191
16:32.670 --> 16:34.620
Please let me go see her.

192
16:50.800 --> 16:54.710
[Phop Phra]

193
16:59.200 --> 17:00.130
Wait for me, my beloved.

194
17:00.600 --> 17:01.940
I'm on my way to you.

195
18:00.810 --> 18:02.420
I received a report last night

196
18:03.410 --> 18:04.800
that a car swerved off the road.

197
18:05.230 --> 18:06.790
At first, I didn't think too much of it,

198
18:07.200 --> 18:09.300
but they said it was Lieutenant Peem's car,

199
18:09.690 --> 18:10.690
so I went to check.

200
18:11.390 --> 18:12.890
The trucker gave a statement,

201
18:13.020 --> 18:15.680
saying that her car crossed into their lane,

202
18:15.700 --> 18:16.790
so the driver veered off to avoid it.

203
18:17.010 --> 18:18.710
That's how her car ended up off the road.

204
18:18.930 --> 18:20.500
Good thing she has no major injuries.

205
18:20.670 --> 18:22.110
And how is the lieutenant holding up?

206
18:22.130 --> 18:23.390
She hasn't regained consciousness yet.

207
19:25.200 --> 19:27.280
From this day forth, whatever may happen,

208
19:28.500 --> 19:30.620
I shall linger by your side.

209
19:31.960 --> 19:33.470
Even when I am not there in flesh...

210
19:35.550 --> 19:37.200
I shall remain with my love.

211
20:30.510 --> 20:31.240
Hello.

212
20:31.800 --> 20:32.820
Hello, Chief.

213
20:34.220 --> 20:35.610
I am Sergeant Piak.

214
20:38.210 --> 20:40.400
Peem told me about you, Sergeant Piak.

215
20:40.830 --> 20:42.840
Thank you so much for taking care of her.

216
20:43.300 --> 20:44.300
With pleasure, ma'am.

217
20:45.320 --> 20:46.150
Alright.

218
21:03.900 --> 21:06.280
Pray you, go and tend to your elder sister.

219
21:12.610 --> 21:14.260
Do not beseech me as though

220
21:14.270 --> 21:16.270
I have the heart of a vicious being, dear Pat.

221
21:17.320 --> 21:19.090
Come what may,

222
21:19.310 --> 21:22.190
I shall not break my own oath.

223
21:24.300 --> 21:25.300
Dear Pat,

224
21:25.570 --> 21:27.880
do not squander your time right here with me.

225
21:28.310 --> 21:31.900
Hurry along to seek the spirit of your beloved elder sister

226
21:32.100 --> 21:33.620
before the ship has sailed.

227
21:38.700 --> 21:41.580
She was born with the charm of metta.

228
21:42.270 --> 21:44.250
This shall aid you, dear Pat.

229
21:45.540 --> 21:48.700
Not only will you save your elder sister's life,

230
21:50.100 --> 21:53.200
but you will also breathe life into your family,

231
21:54.200 --> 21:56.100
those you cherish.

232
21:58.450 --> 22:00.510
Let there be no more losses.

233
22:09.120 --> 22:11.090
Dear vital spirits,

234
22:11.690 --> 22:14.690
wherever you may be, may you return

235
22:15.810 --> 22:17.600
to my dearest karmic soulmate.

236
22:22.500 --> 22:24.010
My heart...

237
22:24.250 --> 22:27.100
feels as though it is about to be torn apart.

238
22:53.920 --> 22:55.900
Wasn't I already here?

239
23:19.420 --> 23:20.920
Go get the doctor!

240
23:47.900 --> 23:49.190
Have you finally come,

241
23:49.710 --> 23:50.900
my dear little sister?

242
24:07.810 --> 24:10.290
Dare you set foot upon Father's sanctum?

243
24:12.100 --> 24:13.530
So where is it, my dear little sister,

244
24:15.230 --> 24:17.490
Father's sorcerous tiger?

245
24:19.190 --> 24:20.490
Why do you never

246
24:21.810 --> 24:23.980
let me lay eyes upon it?

247
24:24.600 --> 24:27.400
The family's arts are meant to serve as a shield,

248
24:27.420 --> 24:29.030
not for mere display.

249
24:29.410 --> 24:30.810
A shield, huh?

250
24:40.710 --> 24:42.300
And whom could you ever shield?

251
24:43.810 --> 24:46.100
Entangling innocent souls in this ordeal,

252
24:46.720 --> 24:48.380
you are nothing but vermin, Zai.

253
24:48.390 --> 24:49.990
I am capable of even more.

254
24:51.810 --> 24:53.120
I can even commit

255
24:53.300 --> 24:54.890
the sin of matricide

256
24:55.420 --> 24:56.640
against the nun!

257
24:57.200 --> 24:58.300
You damn ungrateful wretch.

258
24:58.330 --> 24:59.600
That is your own mother.

259
25:03.210 --> 25:04.500
Someone like yourself

260
25:04.520 --> 25:06.110
cannot be saved.

261
25:10.190 --> 25:11.710
From now on,

262
25:12.210 --> 25:14.480
you are no damn elder brother of mine!

263
25:23.110 --> 25:24.800
Should you wish to witness it,

264
25:24.810 --> 25:26.510
I shall oblige.

265
25:30.220 --> 25:35.200
(Incanting)

266
25:49.610 --> 25:51.800
Father's sorcerous tiger...

267
25:58.490 --> 26:00.110
truly was bequeathed to you.

268
26:05.110 --> 26:05.980
Go!

269
26:16.300 --> 26:17.710
Know you not

270
26:19.800 --> 26:21.110
that the sorcerous tiger...

271
26:22.520 --> 26:24.400
does not harm those of its own family?

272
26:29.600 --> 26:31.200
What a shame

273
26:33.900 --> 26:36.700
that Father bequeathed the arts of the sorcerous tiger to you.

274
26:38.700 --> 26:40.120
Since time immemorial,

275
26:41.320 --> 26:43.400
you have always had everything,

276
26:47.500 --> 26:48.500
unlike me.

277
26:52.400 --> 26:54.290
No matter how hard I persevered,

278
26:55.120 --> 26:56.580
no matter what I did,

279
26:58.210 --> 27:00.490
Father never once grew fond of me.

280
27:03.490 --> 27:04.800
You are the golden child.

281
27:07.510 --> 27:09.010
You did nothing,

282
27:10.510 --> 27:12.410
yet Father almost bequeathed everything to you.

283
27:14.110 --> 27:15.110
Now,

284
27:16.890 --> 27:19.410
I shall make you know the meaning of loss.

285
27:21.810 --> 27:22.910
My dear little sister,

286
27:24.520 --> 27:26.390
do relinquish the arts

287
27:26.700 --> 27:28.000
within you

288
27:30.090 --> 27:31.910
and bestow them upon me,

289
27:35.300 --> 27:37.200
and I shall let everyone live.

290
27:39.790 --> 27:41.400
Should you so much as think to resist,

291
27:42.300 --> 27:44.020
I shall shatter

292
27:44.720 --> 27:47.790
and destroy that girl's soul completely.

293
27:51.700 --> 27:53.180
Let us see

294
27:53.800 --> 27:55.200
how shattered

295
27:56.010 --> 27:57.810
your karmic soulmate can become.

296
27:58.700 --> 27:59.700
This

297
27:59.980 --> 28:02.100
is between you and me!

298
28:02.710 --> 28:05.210
Should your karmic soulmate be rid of the charm of metta,

299
28:06.000 --> 28:09.000
she cannot enhance your virtues as Father proclaimed.

300
28:11.710 --> 28:12.810
Do you scheme

301
28:13.000 --> 28:14.300
to shatter her

302
28:15.500 --> 28:17.110
just so you can destroy me?

303
28:23.010 --> 28:24.210
It seems

304
28:24.600 --> 28:27.800
you and I cannot simply breathe in the same realm.

305
28:29.800 --> 28:31.690
Your final moments...

306
28:32.410 --> 28:33.700
began to unfold

307
28:34.710 --> 28:37.290
the very moment you brushed against my karmic soulmate!

308
28:37.310 --> 28:38.990
No, these are your final moments.

309
28:40.210 --> 28:41.470
This instant,

310
28:41.490 --> 28:42.590
Bulan, you wretch,

311
28:43.520 --> 28:45.300
only your name shall remain.

312
29:29.800 --> 29:31.200
Peem...

313
29:38.020 --> 29:38.910
Pat...

314
29:47.510 --> 29:48.410
How...

315
29:48.820 --> 29:50.590
did you find me?

316
29:54.100 --> 29:56.690
A golden light called me here.

317
29:57.300 --> 30:00.490
I think it's called "the charm of metta."

318
30:01.600 --> 30:04.000
Your karmic soulmate was the one who told me about it.

319
30:16.010 --> 30:18.910
Miss Pichapat Ruechakun,

320
30:19.200 --> 30:21.010
pray you, come and receive the merit

321
30:21.200 --> 30:23.690
I am dedicating to you today.

322
30:28.510 --> 30:30.180
She has been making merit and offering alms,

323
30:30.210 --> 30:32.490
dedicating them to me every time

324
30:33.110 --> 30:36.300
and giving me enough strength to help you.

325
30:43.000 --> 30:44.610
It's Master Bulan,

326
30:44.960 --> 30:46.800
my love.

327
30:49.600 --> 30:51.890
Thank her on my behalf, Peem.

328
30:52.010 --> 30:53.300
And...

329
30:53.710 --> 30:56.110
thank you and Phu both

330
30:56.410 --> 30:58.500
for everything you've always done for me.

331
30:59.490 --> 31:00.720
But right now,

332
31:00.910 --> 31:02.870
it's time for me to do something

333
31:02.890 --> 31:04.190
for both your sakes.

334
31:09.020 --> 31:10.710
Trust me, alright?

335
32:06.100 --> 32:07.800
Your vital spirits

336
32:07.820 --> 32:10.500
are incarcerated by the power of the dark arts.

337
32:11.100 --> 32:13.300
Before this, he had obtained your date of birth,

338
32:13.320 --> 32:14.870
shards of your elemental mediums,

339
32:14.880 --> 32:16.230
your personal belongings,

340
32:16.800 --> 32:19.220
and soil from beneath your feet.

341
32:19.510 --> 32:21.490
But he couldn't cast black magic on you

342
32:21.500 --> 32:23.660
because you were protected by the charm of metta,

343
32:24.300 --> 32:27.780
so he used Mom to slowly weaken its power.

344
32:27.800 --> 32:29.890
Eventually, he was able to steal all of your vital spirits

345
32:29.910 --> 32:31.500
when you got into an accident.

346
32:36.210 --> 32:37.910
So what do I have to do, Pat?

347
32:38.500 --> 32:39.990
We have to get you out of here

348
32:40.010 --> 32:42.000
by setting your vital spirits free.

349
32:46.010 --> 32:47.540
So that means...

350
32:47.910 --> 32:50.110
all I have to do is pull off those damn ropes?

351
32:53.790 --> 32:55.510
Come on. Let's do it, then.

352
33:02.700 --> 33:03.700
What's the matter, Pat?

353
33:04.610 --> 33:06.210
I have to go now.

354
33:08.010 --> 33:09.010
Go where?

355
33:10.190 --> 33:12.790
Peem, you have to hurry back.

356
33:13.010 --> 33:14.600
Everything has its time.

357
33:32.910 --> 33:34.500
I'm sorry, Pat.

358
33:35.320 --> 33:36.320
I...

359
33:37.100 --> 33:39.110
couldn't protect you.

360
33:43.810 --> 33:46.310
Stop blaming yourself

361
33:47.610 --> 33:50.130
for what happened to me.

362
33:59.700 --> 34:00.800
No, Pat.

363
34:00.900 --> 34:02.390
I don't wanna go back just yet.

364
34:02.990 --> 34:04.850
I still want to stay here with you.

365
34:05.830 --> 34:07.600
That can't be, Peem.

366
34:07.800 --> 34:09.510
Everyone's waiting for you.

367
34:10.500 --> 34:11.790
Mom,

368
34:12.220 --> 34:13.620
Dad,

369
34:14.000 --> 34:15.300
Grandma,

370
34:16.290 --> 34:17.710
Phu,

371
34:18.810 --> 34:19.890
and...

372
34:20.820 --> 34:23.200
your karmic soulmate, who's waited for you for so long.

373
34:23.490 --> 34:25.300
Don't keep her waiting any longer.

374
34:30.020 --> 34:31.200
No matter what,

375
34:31.380 --> 34:33.220
we'll meet again one day.

376
34:33.710 --> 34:35.700
You don't have to rush being with me.

377
34:40.410 --> 34:41.900
I promise

378
34:42.200 --> 34:44.330
I will find Phu at all costs,

379
34:44.510 --> 34:46.380
no matter how hard it gets.

380
34:53.320 --> 34:55.310
Good luck, Peem.

381
34:55.610 --> 34:58.360
May you live a happy life from now on.

382
35:37.390 --> 35:39.100
Good luck, Pat.

383
35:58.900 --> 36:01.070
Peem!

384
36:01.090 --> 36:02.270
Peem, you're awake!

385
36:02.690 --> 36:03.630
- Peem... - Lieutenant?

386
36:03.660 --> 36:04.940
Peem, you're awake!

387
36:14.790 --> 36:17.020
Didn't Master Bulan come?

388
36:18.290 --> 36:20.110
She didn't, my dear.

389
36:21.110 --> 36:22.530
But it's alright.

390
36:23.560 --> 36:25.180
Once you're fully recovered,

391
36:25.200 --> 36:26.760
we'll go see her together.

392
36:28.800 --> 36:30.870
Actually, I came here with her,

393
36:35.420 --> 36:36.110
but...

394
36:36.300 --> 36:38.600
when I opened the door to see you and your family,

395
36:39.000 --> 36:40.400
she was no longer here.

396
36:44.510 --> 36:45.680
Master...

397
36:45.700 --> 36:47.720
is a woman of her word

398
36:48.220 --> 36:50.280
because she said

399
36:50.300 --> 36:52.480
she'd never come see you again

400
36:53.300 --> 36:57.310
until your mother accepts her.

401
36:58.800 --> 37:01.220
She would never break her oath.

402
37:05.600 --> 37:06.600
Thong...

403
37:08.420 --> 37:09.420
Peem?

404
37:11.400 --> 37:12.400
Thong...

405
37:14.100 --> 37:15.310
Mom?

406
37:17.030 --> 37:18.030
Thong...

407
37:21.410 --> 37:23.330
Where's your mommy?

408
37:24.290 --> 37:26.580
Why didn't she come to see me?

409
37:36.640 --> 37:38.480
Mom, please help Mommy.

410
37:38.500 --> 37:40.920
Mommy is vanquishing Master Zai at the sanctum.

411
37:41.220 --> 37:43.900
Even though her arts are powerful,

412
37:43.920 --> 37:45.700
I am afraid

413
37:45.720 --> 37:47.750
his trickery will put her in danger.

414
37:49.300 --> 37:50.400
I'll be there right now.

415
37:51.010 --> 37:52.520
- Peem, what are you doing? - Peem!

416
37:52.540 --> 37:53.510
- Peem, Peem! - Lieutenant, Lieutenant, Lieutenant.

417
37:53.530 --> 37:54.170
- Peem! - Peem!

418
37:54.180 --> 37:55.190
- Peem! - Lieutenant, Lieutenant!

419
37:55.200 --> 37:56.770
- Calm down, Lieutenant. - Peem!

420
37:56.790 --> 37:58.580
- She's in danger, Dad. - Lieutenant.

421
37:58.600 --> 37:59.920
I have to help her.

422
37:59.940 --> 38:01.880
- Peem, please don't go. - Don't... You can't go, dear.

423
38:01.900 --> 38:03.900
- You're still hurt! - Lieutenant, calm down.

424
38:03.920 --> 38:04.770
- Peem. - Lieutenant.

425
38:04.790 --> 38:06.270
It's dangerous, Peem.

426
38:06.410 --> 38:10.030
Listen, we'll have Sergeant Piak and the other officers help her!

427
38:11.110 --> 38:12.390
No, Mom.

428
38:13.720 --> 38:16.010
The only one who can save Bulan

429
38:16.030 --> 38:17.920
is me, Mom.

430
38:20.490 --> 38:21.490
I'm going.

431
38:21.520 --> 38:22.660
- Sarge... - Lieutenant, calm down.

432
38:22.690 --> 38:24.200
- Take me to her. - Don't!

433
38:24.210 --> 38:25.450
Lieutenant, no.

434
38:25.460 --> 38:26.380
Please don't, Lieutenant.

435
38:35.090 --> 38:36.410
Grandma,

436
38:38.200 --> 38:40.920
I really can't live without her.

437
38:42.590 --> 38:44.510
Do you understand me?

438
38:45.810 --> 38:47.720
I'm begging you, Grandma.

439
38:48.320 --> 38:49.000
Please...

440
38:49.590 --> 38:51.570
I understand you, Peem.

441
38:52.290 --> 38:53.290
Peem...

442
38:53.320 --> 38:54.730
listen to me.

443
38:55.120 --> 38:57.020
You have to recover here first.

444
38:58.640 --> 39:00.580
The Master will be alright, dear.

445
39:00.590 --> 39:02.310
She will definitely be alright.

446
39:02.600 --> 39:03.990
I'm on my knees.

447
39:04.110 --> 39:05.900
Peem, Peem...

448
39:05.910 --> 39:08.190
- Peem... - May I go to her, Mom?

449
39:09.620 --> 39:10.570
I really can't live

450
39:10.580 --> 39:12.020
- without her, Mom. - Peem!

451
39:12.030 --> 39:13.850
- Peem... - Peem!

452
39:13.880 --> 39:15.300
- Just tell me - Peem...

453
39:15.310 --> 39:16.960
however many times you want me to beg.

454
39:16.970 --> 39:17.840
Peem...

455
39:18.280 --> 39:19.080
Peem...

456
39:19.220 --> 39:21.040
- I really can't live without her, Mom. - Peem!

457
39:21.060 --> 39:22.670
I'm sorry, dear.

458
39:23.190 --> 39:25.500
I really can't let you.

459
39:25.520 --> 39:28.010
I love you, dear. Don't go...

460
39:28.120 --> 39:29.620
I'm sorry...

461
39:31.700 --> 39:33.190
Peem...

462
39:51.420 --> 39:53.400
Om, arise by my command.

463
39:53.420 --> 39:54.550
Arise in your entirety.

464
39:54.570 --> 39:55.770
Arise by the sacred incantation.

465
39:55.790 --> 39:57.510
Arise by the chant.

466
39:57.530 --> 39:59.200
Bound by the sacred verse.

467
40:22.620 --> 40:24.200
Master was not mistaken.

468
40:24.510 --> 40:26.890
One day, you would succumb to the dark arts,

469
40:27.310 --> 40:30.390
return, and act like a despicable fiend.

470
40:33.800 --> 40:35.120
It is no wonder

471
40:35.600 --> 40:37.880
the late master withheld his teachings from you.

472
40:43.620 --> 40:45.590
He was never mistaken, you say?

473
40:47.690 --> 40:48.760
You.

474
40:49.610 --> 40:51.400
You truly know him inside out, do you not?

475
40:52.800 --> 40:54.040
What a pity

476
40:57.040 --> 40:59.040
he is not here to witness

477
41:01.710 --> 41:04.280
how the very sacred arts he bestowed upon you

478
41:06.260 --> 41:08.320
became utterly worthless in your hands.

479
41:13.110 --> 41:14.720
His sacred arts

480
41:16.210 --> 41:17.790
belong to me.

481
41:24.600 --> 41:26.100
I am eager to see

482
41:28.000 --> 41:29.690
how long his grace

483
41:30.110 --> 41:32.070
can protect you from me.

484
41:43.710 --> 41:44.710
Peem...

485
41:46.120 --> 41:47.200
My dearest.

486
41:48.110 --> 41:52.490
"I had Sergeant wait for you at the back entrance of the hospital."

487
41:53.810 --> 41:55.680
Follow the path.

488
41:56.610 --> 41:58.520
As for your parents,

489
41:58.540 --> 42:00.120
I'll look after them on your behalf.

490
42:01.200 --> 42:02.320
Go forth, dear.

491
42:03.990 --> 42:06.990
Go and aid your karmic soulmate.

492
42:07.800 --> 42:08.890
Thank you, Grandma.

493
42:08.910 --> 42:09.910
Yes, dear.

494
42:16.000 --> 42:17.020
Thank you

495
42:17.030 --> 42:19.000
for lending me a hand, Sarge.

496
42:19.730 --> 42:21.520
Yes, boss. With pleasure.

497
42:26.790 --> 42:28.840
How foolishly you rush to your own grave.

498
42:33.700 --> 42:34.720
My dearest.

499
43:24.060 --> 43:25.160
I saw it.

500
43:26.600 --> 43:29.210
You are a bearer of the charm of metta, which enhances one's virtues.

501
43:30.690 --> 43:32.160
Yet in the end,

502
43:35.020 --> 43:36.710
you are nothing more than a common mortal.

503
43:50.040 --> 43:51.100
Bulan,

504
43:52.610 --> 43:54.090
how fortunate you are

505
43:55.110 --> 43:56.780
to have souls who wish to protect you.

506
43:59.320 --> 44:00.320
Thong!

507
44:05.100 --> 44:06.560
If it is death you all crave,

508
44:08.000 --> 44:10.080
I shall grant your wish to the fullest.

509
44:21.720 --> 44:22.790
Cease this at once.

510
44:23.640 --> 44:25.300
If it is Father's sacred arts you seek,

511
44:25.710 --> 44:26.840
I shall bestow them upon you.

512
44:29.050 --> 44:30.680
No, my beloved!

513
44:31.190 --> 44:32.360
Let her go.

514
44:32.700 --> 44:34.660
This matter is between you and me

515
44:35.100 --> 44:36.120
alone.

516
44:47.800 --> 44:49.080
Stop this, my beloved.

517
44:56.110 --> 44:58.280
Don't do this.

518
45:06.410 --> 45:09.190
Keep Father's sacred arts to yourself if you wish,

519
45:10.720 --> 45:14.300
so that I may crush the very soul of your karmic soulmate

520
45:14.910 --> 45:16.710
into dust.

521
45:20.700 --> 45:22.320
Keep that mouth of yours

522
45:22.520 --> 45:24.600
ready to scream when you rot in hell.

523
45:25.510 --> 45:27.990
Though his sacred arts are paramount,

524
45:28.750 --> 45:31.760
if a life must be sacrificed to preserve them,

525
45:32.720 --> 45:34.400
I will readily forsake them

526
45:34.710 --> 45:36.040
for the sake of righteousness.

527
45:37.410 --> 45:38.690
Of course.

528
45:40.410 --> 45:42.220
You were always his cherished favorite.

529
45:43.510 --> 45:45.400
You are the daughter he was truly proud of.

530
45:47.860 --> 45:51.170
I never curried favor with Father to inherit his sacred arts, and you know it!

531
45:51.190 --> 45:53.000
Even so, you got everything anyway:

532
45:54.290 --> 45:55.400
the sanctum,

533
45:56.500 --> 45:57.680
the sacred arts,

534
45:58.500 --> 45:59.820
and the sorcerous tiger.

535
46:02.110 --> 46:03.420
And what about me?

536
46:07.400 --> 46:08.630
Why then

537
46:12.020 --> 46:14.190
was I never once worthy of his pride?

538
46:15.110 --> 46:16.160
Zai.

539
46:16.710 --> 46:17.920
Do you even know

540
46:18.410 --> 46:20.340
what I had to endure?

541
46:21.500 --> 46:23.800
All the burdens and all the pain.

542
46:25.390 --> 46:26.210
Very well.

543
46:27.110 --> 46:28.760
If it is all that you desire,

544
46:29.810 --> 46:33.000
I shall yield every last bit of it to you.

545
46:33.720 --> 46:35.240
Spare me your threats.

546
46:36.500 --> 46:37.500
I know full well

547
46:38.800 --> 46:40.560
the price that must be paid.

548
46:44.330 --> 46:45.560
Yet I shall take it,

549
46:47.410 --> 46:49.000
even if it costs me my very being.

550
46:49.880 --> 46:50.990
That being so,

551
46:51.010 --> 46:52.600
take it.

552
46:57.080 --> 47:06.810
(Incanting)

553
47:45.710 --> 47:48.190
Come forth, Sacred Master.

554
47:49.850 --> 47:51.960
Descend and dwell within this vessel.

555
48:26.690 --> 48:27.690
My beloved...

556
48:45.140 --> 48:47.560
I make this vow

557
48:49.100 --> 48:53.560
to the heavens, the earth, and all sacred beings.

558
48:55.490 --> 48:59.300
If I cannot protect the one I love,

559
49:00.520 --> 49:03.200
I shall forsake all faith,

560
49:04.000 --> 49:05.780
cast aside even the law itself,

561
49:05.800 --> 49:07.720
and turn my back on righteousness.

562
49:26.050 --> 49:26.760
My beloved...

563
49:26.990 --> 49:28.000
My beloved.

564
49:33.400 --> 49:34.900
Tell me you're fine.

565
49:35.810 --> 49:37.190
I am well.

566
49:38.800 --> 49:40.320
I am well...

567
50:10.490 --> 50:13.240
Here shall you both meet your end!

568
50:53.610 --> 50:54.860
Save me!

569
50:59.310 --> 51:00.790
His time

570
51:01.290 --> 51:03.040
has come, has it not?

571
51:07.900 --> 51:09.690
I bestow this upon you:

572
51:11.210 --> 51:12.840
my lower garment.

573
51:13.900 --> 51:15.320
Use this

574
51:16.400 --> 51:17.840
to put an end to him.

575
51:23.000 --> 51:24.560
What is going on, my beloved?

576
51:25.590 --> 51:27.120
Mother's lower garment.

577
51:27.990 --> 51:30.720
It strips him of all powers.

578
51:31.400 --> 51:33.440
His flesh writhes in turmoil.

579
51:33.600 --> 51:36.410
The sacred arts war violently with his dark sorcery.

580
51:53.410 --> 51:55.600
If I remain worthy to be

581
51:55.620 --> 51:58.100
the true keeper of these arts,

582
51:59.110 --> 52:00.900
let all sacred knowledge

583
52:01.620 --> 52:03.960
return unto me at once.

584
52:29.510 --> 52:33.810
If I truly remain worthy to carry this legacy,

585
52:34.490 --> 52:38.800
let all sacred arts return unto me.

586
53:16.600 --> 53:17.720
My dearest.

587
53:18.110 --> 53:19.900
Do open your eyes.

588
54:15.000 --> 54:15.990
[Inthu Sinthamrong, deceased: 6 January 2019]

589
54:16.010 --> 54:17.090
[Chantharametha Kritpirat, deceased: 4 November 2026]

590
54:17.110 --> 54:19.600
It is the karma of his boundless desire.

591
54:20.800 --> 54:23.010
Even his physical form

592
54:23.300 --> 54:24.800
has burned away into nothingness,

593
54:25.500 --> 54:27.300
leaving no soul to be blessed.

594
54:30.210 --> 54:31.800
If it is your wish,

595
54:32.000 --> 54:34.100
I shall grant him my forgiveness,

596
54:34.890 --> 54:36.330
for his deeds thus far

597
54:36.350 --> 54:39.440
have condemned him to eternal torment.

598
54:39.610 --> 54:41.410
There is no need for us to harbor any ill will.

599
54:45.500 --> 54:46.900
From this day forth,

600
54:47.610 --> 54:49.800
you shall no longer suffer on his account.

601
54:52.120 --> 54:53.510
All sorrow and grief

602
54:54.610 --> 54:57.590
shall be no more.

603
55:00.700 --> 55:03.200
I bestow my blessing upon you both:

604
55:04.220 --> 55:05.720
walk side by side,

605
55:05.910 --> 55:07.640
ever guided by mercy,

606
55:09.600 --> 55:11.180
and may virtue,

607
55:11.800 --> 55:13.890
mindfulness, and wisdom

608
55:14.480 --> 55:17.760
lead your steps into tranquility.

609
55:18.650 --> 55:20.500
May you be karmic soulmates,

610
55:20.520 --> 55:23.300
blessed with happiness and eternal prosperity.

611
55:27.310 --> 55:28.700
Thank you, Mother.

612
55:33.400 --> 55:34.920
From this moment forth,

613
55:35.190 --> 55:37.110
leave the duty of

614
55:38.710 --> 55:40.300
watching over Bulan

615
55:40.990 --> 55:42.490
with me.

616
55:44.890 --> 55:46.700
With no lingering attachments left behind,

617
55:47.190 --> 55:51.030
may you pass peacefully into a higher realm.

618
55:51.710 --> 55:53.600
Rest your heart and be free.

619
56:05.720 --> 56:07.410
The reason I visited today

620
56:07.590 --> 56:09.920
is that I wish to apologize for breaking my oath

621
56:13.210 --> 56:15.600
and seeing your daughter

622
56:18.280 --> 56:20.560
before permitted time, madam.

623
56:22.310 --> 56:24.790
I was the one who went to see her.

624
56:25.610 --> 56:27.500
Mom, Dad,

625
56:27.520 --> 56:28.800
if you're gonna be mad,

626
56:29.030 --> 56:30.490
please do so at me.

627
56:31.290 --> 56:33.640
Don't blame it on her.

628
56:37.710 --> 56:39.440
Look how much you love each other.

629
56:40.100 --> 56:41.560
Jeez, Ratchapee!

630
56:41.900 --> 56:44.720
When are you gonna stop getting between them!?

631
56:46.290 --> 56:47.290
Mother,

632
56:47.960 --> 56:49.760
we haven't even discussed

633
56:49.770 --> 56:50.800
how you deceived me

634
56:51.000 --> 56:53.110
and let Peem leave the hospital

635
56:53.120 --> 56:54.950
when she was still hurt.

636
56:57.410 --> 56:58.310
None of your business...

637
56:59.040 --> 57:00.040
How did she know?

638
57:07.390 --> 57:10.320
No one's wronged me by breaking an oath.

639
57:12.500 --> 57:15.180
I was the only one in the wrong

640
57:16.640 --> 57:20.220
for believing that my child's life was mine,

641
57:21.910 --> 57:23.480
when in fact,

642
57:24.590 --> 57:26.410
her life and heart

643
57:28.510 --> 57:30.080
belong to her.

644
57:31.140 --> 57:32.690
As a mother,

645
57:32.810 --> 57:34.300
whoever my daughter loves,

646
57:35.800 --> 57:37.800
I should love them, too.

647
57:39.520 --> 57:41.280
Knowing it's you,

648
57:42.910 --> 57:45.680
I have nothing to worry about

649
57:46.510 --> 57:48.100
because you've proven

650
57:48.120 --> 57:49.920
that you love my daughter

651
57:50.110 --> 57:52.240
as much as your own life.

652
57:53.520 --> 57:55.880
And I have no further doubts

653
57:56.110 --> 57:58.120
about your love for each other.

654
58:03.120 --> 58:03.810
Right.

655
58:04.300 --> 58:05.480
Thank you very much.

656
58:08.290 --> 58:10.000
